#: scenario7:scenario7_9ED0C5D0_A167_4441_98DD_EA5BCB38F709
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fac03f0c91a24b624deb74f937ce612a5ae00695725716a38e4c9dc3bc198ad0
#. default-sha256: bc5563ca56712a85ad546a4e2683f5f96ed03c6f3c28902a1114d7f046202207
